# Guarded paths

Stop and ask before editing these files.

- `.npmignore` — controls the published tarball
- `.github/workflows/*` — CI/CD; explain the reason, wait for approval
- `template/package.json` — baseline RN versions for every generated app
- `template/android/gradle/wrapper/**` and `template/ios/**/*.pbxproj` — no drive-by native churn

If the task seems to require a change here, state why in one sentence and wait.
